MathLive 0.111.0 - vendored.

Source: npm package mathlive@0.111.0 (npm pack mathlive@0.111.0), retrieved on 2026-10-26.
  npm integrity: sha512-jOcmftawnJgFerkOxKk8aVZeOxL9qgX/kF2D9+AOL5MpNYWYllXpkzDs1uSWJEUAOZhJuq86jzL18/1j0oOLWg==
